li^2]*Sqrt[MB]*(2*MB - R)*R^(3/2)*(-2*I + omega*R)*SWSHtheta[1, li, mi, Pi/2] \
+ 
    MB*(8*MB^2 + 2*MB*R*(-6 + li + li^2 - (3*I)*omega*R) + R^2*(2 - li - li^2 \
- (2*I)*omega*R + 2*omega^2*R^2))*SWSHtheta[2, li, mi, Pi/2]) + 
  2*Sqrt[MB]*(2*MB - R)*R*((-I)*Sqrt[-2 + li + li^2]*Sqrt[R]*(-2*MB + \
R)*SWSHtheta[1, li, mi, Pi/2] + Sqrt[MB]*(MB + I*omega*R^2)*SWSHtheta[2, li, \
mi, Pi/2])*Derivative[0, 0, 0, 1][RadHZ][li, mi, omega, R])/(24*MB - 8*R);\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9330484819780254`*^9, 3.933048507320324*^9}, 
